en. Trotz des Widerstands einiger Verbände hält die Koalition an ihrem Plan fest. Innerhalb der nächsten fünf Jahre soll der Ausstoß deutlich sinken. Angesichts des internationalen Drucks gilt ein Scheitern als ausgeschlossen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Zeitungsartikel über Umweltpolitik","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, im Bericht steht: \"Aufgrund des Anlasses wurde die Veranstaltung verschoben.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_064_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"\" Klingt das nicht zu förmlich?","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_064_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Für einen offiziellen Bericht passt das genau.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_064_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Bezüglich der Tagesordnung — hast du die schon ergänzt?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_064_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Noch nicht ganz.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_064_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-64-praepositionen-mit-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Aber zugunsten der Übersichtlichkeit sollten wir sie kürzen.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRol